.vs/
.idea/
*.sln.docstates

## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
packages/
!**/packages/build/
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

## ASP.NET Core
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
wwwroot/lib/

## Entity Framework
*.mdf
*.ldf
Migrations/

## Publishing
**/publish/
**/PublishProfiles/

## Logs & temp
logs/
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
npm-debug.log*

## Environment & secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pfx
secrets.json

## Node / frontend
node_modules/
dist/
.npm/

## OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## Docker
docker-compose.override.yml